  "name": "AutopilotSnap",
  "description": "AutopilotSnap is a free, browser-based tool for technicians preparing Windows devices. Scan the Windows Autopilot QR code, review the detected device, and generate a CSV (Manufacturer, Model, Serial) to upload to Intune as corporate device identifiers. No sign-in, no backend, and all data stays in your browser. This independent community project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.",
